sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant RouteUI as OpenShift Route<br/>(planner)<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant RouteAPI as OpenShift Route<br/>(planner-backend)<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant SQLite as SQLite DB<br/>/app/db/planner.db
    participant Ollama as Ollama<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI-compatible API<br/>HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User, K8sAPI: User Request Flow
    User->>RouteUI: HTTPS (TLS terminated)
    RouteUI->>UI: HTTP/8501
    UI->>Backend: HTTP/8000 (ClusterIP)
    Backend-->>UI: JSON Response
    UI-->>RouteUI: Response
    RouteUI-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User, K8sAPI: Direct API Access Flow
    User->>RouteAPI: POST /api/v1/recommend<br/>HTTPS (TLS terminated)
    RouteAPI->>Backend: HTTP/8000
    Backend-->>RouteAPI: JSON Response
    RouteAPI-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User, K8sAPI: LLM Inference Flow (Ollama)
    User->>RouteUI: Request capacity plan
    RouteUI->>UI: HTTP/8501
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>Ollama: POST /api/chat<br/>HTTP/11434 (ClusterIP, no TLS)
    Ollama-->>Backend: LLM Response
    Backend-->>UI: Structured extraction
    UI-->>User: Rendered plan

    Note over User, K8sAPI: LLM Inference Flow (OpenAI-compatible)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>OpenAI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS (OpenAI SDK)<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
    OpenAI-->>Backend: LLM Response
    Backend-->>UI: Structured extraction

    Note over User, K8sAPI: GPU Detection Flow
    UI->>Backend: GET /api/v1/gpu-types<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>K8sAPI: list_node()<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Node list<br/>(nvidia.com/gpu.product labels)
    Backend-->>Backend: Cache result (TTL 300s)
    Backend-->>UI: Available GPU types

    Note over User, K8sAPI: Data Persistence Flow
    User->>RouteAPI: POST /api/v1/db/upload-benchmarks<br/>HTTPS
    RouteAPI->>Backend: HTTP/8000
    Backend->>Backend: Verify DB_ADMIN_PASSWORD
    Backend->>SQLite: Write benchmark data<br/>(PVC-backed)
    SQLite-->>Backend: OK
    Backend-->>RouteAPI: Upload result
    RouteAPI-->>User: HTTPS Response
